2. Upload to your Resume Analyzer web interface
3. Check if the NER model correctly extracts:
   - SKILL: Technical and professional competencies
   - JOB_TITLE: Job designations/roles
   - EXPERIENCE_DURATION: Years of experience
   - DEGREE: Educational qualifications
   - INSTITUTION: Company names and educational institutions
   - CERTIFICATION: Professional certificates and qualifications

4. Compare extracted entities against the bold text in each resume
5. Note any misclassifications, especially for:
   - EXPERIENCE_DURATION (known issue)
   - CERTIFICATION (weak F1 score)

===================================================================================